alwaysApply: true
---


To access all data for dev purpose, authenticate as admin with `ADMIN_SECRET` as the bearer token. On ODAS (Cloud Run), read it with `gcloud secrets versions access latest --secret=ODAS_ADMIN_SECRET --project=odis-stream2-app`; locally it is `ADMIN_SECRET` in `.env`. This repository is public: never write secret values in tracked files.

Only an admin can run pipeline and have full access to the app features.
